Node ID=10 shared
Text=Fresh meat walks in on its own feet.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=11 shared
Text=<It sniffs at the air and will not look away.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=12 shared
Text=Hold still. You are better whole.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=13 shared
Text=The pot is already hot, morsel.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=14 shared
Text=We are many. You are one meal.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=15 shared
Text=Khan eats first. We eat after. You are the after.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=16 shared
Text=Soft skin. No shell. Good.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=17 shared
Text=Your bones go in the broth. The rest of you goes in the bowl.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=18 shared
Text=You brought your own meat here. That was kind of you.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=19 shared
Text=Thin arms. Thin neck. Thin all over.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 shared
Text=I have not eaten since the last one.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=21 shared
Text=<He is grinning, and it is all teeth and no humour.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=22 shared
Text=Stand in the light so I can see the meat on you.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=23 shared
Text=We will not waste any of you. That is respect.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=24 shared
Text=Do not spoil. Do not spoil!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=25 shared
Text=You smell like the clean ones. The clean ones taste of soap.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=26 shared
Text=Come down where it is dark and we will talk about supper.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=27 shared
Text=Every one of us is hungrier than you are brave.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 rabble
Text=Wumjup says you are small. Wumjup is wrong about everything.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=31 rabble
Text=Me first! Me first!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=32 rabble
Text=<He starts forward, then waits to see if anything else does.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=33 rabble
Text=Grum got the last one. Grum always gets the last one.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=34 rabble
Text=Die quick and we share. Die slow and we do not.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=35 rabble
Text=Mongol-trained! Mongol-trained!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=36 rabble
Text=There are more of us than there is of you!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=37 rabble
Text=Hrubjub! Hrubjub, get its legs!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=38 rabble
Text=I called the liver. I called it first.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=39 rabble
Text=<He glances behind him before he steps forward.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=40 rabble
Text=If you kill me, kill the one beside me too. He is worse.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=41 rabble
Text=Khan gives meat to whoever bleeds it. I want meat.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=42 rabble
Text=It is only one of them! It is only one!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=43 rabble
Text=Scream more. The screaming makes it tender.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=44 rabble
Text=My brother went in a pot like yours. Now you go in his.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=45 rabble
Text=We are the scourge of the land! Somebody said so!
Should Have Voiceover=0
