Node ID=50 archer
Text=Stay where you are standing. It is easier for me.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=51 archer
Text=No closer, meat. I like you at this distance.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=52 archer
Text=<He draws without hurrying.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=53 archer
Text=One in the leg first. Then we talk about the pot.
