------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=54 archer
Text=Khan says do not waste arrows. Khan is not here.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=55 archer
Text=I have shot bigger. I have eaten smaller.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=56 archer
Text=Run about more. It makes the day interesting.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=57 archer
Text=<He licks the arrowhead before he fits it.>
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=58 archer
Text=I count them going in. I always count.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=59 archer
Text=I do not have to be brave at this range.
